      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit your camera in real time with Vidu S2-Editing, steered by a reference image instead of a prompt. Pick a camera in Reactor Camera Capture, queue the prompt, allow camera access, and the edited video plays in the Reactor Realtime window. Pick another edit type or a new image in that window and press Apply to switch the look. Press Done to end the take; it is saved as a video under reactor/realtime. Cancel ends it without saving.\n\nVidu S2-Editing prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/vidu-s2-editing/prompt-guide\n\nvirtual_tryon dresses you in the item in the image, here a sequined jacket. Use an image that shows only the item. Light yourself evenly from the front and keep the camera moving. Copy example_inputs/reactor_outfit_sequined_jacket.jpg into ComfyUI's input folder first. Set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Edit your camera in real time with Vidu S2-Editing, steered by a reference image instead of a prompt. Pick a camera in Reactor Camera Capture, queue the prompt, allow camera access, and the edited video plays in the Reactor Realtime window. Pick another edit type or a new image in that window and press Apply to switch the look. Press Done to end the take; it is saved as a video under reactor/realtime. Cancel ends it without saving.\n\nsubject_replacement puts the person in the image in your place. style_transfer takes its look, virtual_tryon an outfit, and background_replacement a new background. Copy example_inputs/reactor_fisherman.jpg into ComfyUI's input folder first. Set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
